{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, their ventures are rooted in personal passion","evidence":"[D1:4 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Jon: Sorry to hear that! I'm starting a dance studio 'cause I'm passionate about dancing and it'd be great to share it with others.\n[D6:8 | 2:35 pm on 16 March, 2023] Gina: Thanks! I'm passionate about fashion trends and finding unique pieces. Plus, I wanted to blend my love for dance and fashion, so it was a perfect match.","itemId":"urn:uuid:27a720b0-2ec1-5a07-ad9f-576921b18761","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:95be31be4ed2d7f568e87428b1e3c18a83e580d4b435acb2cfe304fb27643196","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do Jon and Gina start businesses out of what they love?","referenceAnswer":"Yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"95be31be4ed2d7f568e87428b1e3c18a83e580d4b435acb2cfe304fb27643196"}}]}